him, and even called him "test", uncapitalised. My little barbarian was
happily strolling through the dungeon, but after having found both an
altar *and* an uncursed luckstone on the first level of the dungeon, I
decided to continue this character.

A luckstone and a co-aligned altar. Yep, I should have known something was
wrong from the beginning...

Anyway, he explored through level 5, then went up to buc-id all the items
he'd found (level 5 was a bones level, and quite easy to defeat).

After that, he descended into the Mines, only to find them quite empty. No
gnomes to be seen anywhere, in hindsight. But since he arrived there in
one of the corners, it didn't strike me as such.

He walked from the top right of the level to the bottom right, into
another dead end, when suddenly: "Snertkat hits!  Snertkat hits!  Snertkat
bites!  Snertkat hits!  Snertkat hits!  Snertkat bites!".

